---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Icon from "@/components/Icon.astro";
import SplitHeading from "@/components/SplitHeading.astro";
import { PRACTICE } from "@/lib/practice";
import visit from "@/assets/home/dpc-visit.webp";
---

<section class="dpc3 section" id="what-is-dpc" aria-labelledby="dpc-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="dpc3-grid">
      <div class="dpc3-media">
        <div class="dpc3-arch" data-reveal="img">
          <Image
            src={visit}
            widths={[900, 1400]}
            sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 470px"
            alt="Dr. Qureshi taking notes during an unhurried visit with a patient"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="dpc3-glass" data-reveal style="--d:.25s">
          <span class="dpc3-glass-k">For a flat monthly fee</span>
          <ul>
            <li>No copays</li>
            <li>No deductibles</li>
            <li>No surprise fees</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="dpc3-copy">
        <span class="label" data-reveal>Direct Primary Care</span>
        <SplitHeading
          id="dpc-title"
          text="What is Direct Primary Care"
          accent="(DPC)?"
        />
        <p class="lead" data-reveal>
          Direct Primary Care (DPC) is a simple, transparent model that creates
          a direct relationship between you and your physician. Instead of
          working through insurance, your doctor works directly for you. For a
          flat monthly fee, patients enjoy unlimited access to their physician,
          no copays, no deductibles, and no surprise fees.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Without the constraints of insurance, physicians are able to spend
          more time with each patient, addressing multiple concerns in one
          unhurried visit. Open and flexible scheduling means you can be seen
          when you&rsquo;re actually sick, helping reduce unnecessary emergency
          room visits. When appropriate, care can also be provided by phone or
          secure messaging, often eliminating the need for an office visit
          altogether.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Patients also benefit from deeply discounted labs, imaging, and
          medications, along with clear, upfront pricing. With Direct Primary
          Care, there are no unexpected bills, just straightforward, affordable
          care.
        </p>
        <div class="sec-actions" data-reveal>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/services/"
            >View All Services <Icon name="arrow" /></a
          >
          <a
            class="btn btn--outline"
            href={PRACTICE.bookingUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener">Schedule Now</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
